    "The actual RemoteRoutes apps reply is ok-only and is retained; Home explicit success, negative ok and dispatched:false feedback controls are covered. No server response grammar or native action implementation changes.",
    "The frozen regression file appends ten cases to six unchanged playback cases. Its five malformed envelopes use the actual controller and public Show Home button through the unchanged generated DOM/HTTP harness, assert one request and literal error feedback, and prohibit the success notice. Five new controls cover explicit success, Apps ok-only, rejection, failed dispatch and departed-room feedback ownership.",
    "Baseline has five actual AssertionErrors and eleven passing controls. The identical frozen test passes all sixteen against the candidate; the full thirty-five-file Node gate passes all 753.",
    "Android build tasks exit zero. Every 475 JUnit XML file was read, counted and hashed: 4565 tests and testcase elements, with zero failures/errors/skips.",
    "Both frozen APKs decode to com.immortal.launcher.debug 1.173/code167 and the same baseline signer certificate. All 23 source asset payloads match current source; remote/control-center.js is the sole changed asset entry against each 1.172 baseline. All other 22 source assets and generated profiles are byte-identical.",
    "app/build.gradle.kts reconstructs through only version166/1.172 to167/1.173 replacement; public version.json remains1.83/code77."
  ],
